  "details": "Every new player in vrchat should be taught the basics of finding and traveling between worlds, switching avatars, and ESPECIALLY turning other user's avatar's on. This change would not only eliminate the confusion of what avatar imposters and fallbacks are for new users, but would also stop people from having to rely on others to figure out how to actually see avatars in the first place, and encourage them to familiarize themselves with the menus and settings while they're at it.",
